<title>UK: John Mowlem first half profits 5.3 mln stg.</title>
<headline>John Mowlem first half profits 5.3 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		2.6		    vs 18.3 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.0		    vs nil</p>
<p>Pretax		     5.3		    vs 32.0 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		    693		    vs 741</p>
<p>NOTE - John Mowlem Plc also said on Friday that it was considering a partial flotation of its access products and services unit in 1997.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 8.0		    vs 11.6 loss</p>
<p> Interest payable	 2.7		    vs 2.4</p>
<p> Tax			  0.7		    vs 0.2</p>
<p> Net taxed		  4.6		    vs 32.0 loss</p>
<p> Pay date		   December 31</p>
<p>Div registration date  October 15  Ex-div date		October 7</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
